  - m_Id: 3589773437591552
    m_Localized: It is recommended to pass if you have never played Toad tales.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3589548358656000
    m_Localized: Start the run with a defence bonus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3589714104967168
    m_Localized: Start the run without any bonuses. Passing the game in the experienced
      toad mode will open the ascensions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3596202319962112
    m_Localized: 'Start the run with harder rules:

      - the starting reward is
      less'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3596923308236800
    m_Localized: 'Start the run with harder rules:

      - the starting reward is
      less

      - more enemies on the map at the same time

      - It requires
      more score points to go to the camp

      - stronger opponents start to appear
      faster

      - for some opponents, the maximum of AP increases

      - cancer
      hermits appear less frequently

      - stronger opponents start to appear
      even faster

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
